; A run of wall which does not come back to where it started, and which nothing
; is the boundary of. A traversal which stops is still a traversal, and drawing
; it has to reach the corner it stopped at rather than the last one it set off
; from.
(vertex geom:V-51
  (label "Screen wall, west end")
  (frame frame:building)
  (position
    (value (50.0 0.0 0.0) m)
    (source "Interior control set IC-01, Acme Surveys")
